                    Economic Sub-Committee” (file No. 740.00119 (Potsdam)/7–3145), which describes
                    this paper as “Statistics by Pauley
                    Group”.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d943-f2" n="2" xml:id="d943-f2-content">
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Sic</hi>.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
